.container
  .sign_in
    %p
      - if Morph::Forge.available.size > 1
        Your scrapers live in git repositories on GitHub or GitLab, so that is how you sign in to #{hostname}.
        If you don't have an account on either you will need to register one.
      - else
        Everything on #{hostname} is hooked into GitHub. If you don't have a GitHub account you will need to register one.
    %p
      = sign_in_buttons class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg"
